# Telegram Text-to-Speech Bot

Converts text into natural-sounding speech with selectable voices,
languages, speed, and audio format. Built with python-telegram-bot,
FastAPI (webhook mode), SQLAlchemy, and ffmpeg. Deployed on Railway.

## Commands

- `/start` — welcome message, registers you as a user
- `/help` — list all commands
- `/tts <text>` — convert text to speech (or reply to a message with /tts)
- `/voices` — choose a voice
- `/language` — choose a language
- `/settings` — view/adjust speed and audio format
- `/about` — about this bot

You can also just paste text with no command and it'll convert automatically.

## Local development

1. Install ffmpeg (required for audio processing):
   ```bash
   # macOS
   brew install ffmpeg
   # Ubuntu/Debian
   sudo apt install ffmpeg
